# v1 kept its generated suites in a top-level tests/ directory. Anchored to the
# root, because an unanchored "tests/" matches at every depth -- it silently
# swallowed tests_autef2/sample_project/tests/, the fixture's deliberately
# broken suite, and a fresh clone then failed 21 of its own tests.
/tests/
#source_files/
mutation_coverage/
mutation_coverage_before/
mutation_coverage_after/
backup_files/
